106 of 130 mutants move NOTHING in the two tiers measured here;
the rest MOVE OUTPUT, and a survivor among those is a real coverage gap.

SCOPE, AND IT IS NOT A FORMALITY. This measures the REQUEST-INTENT tier and the EXECUTOR
GATE only. A construct acting in the receipt/belt tier, the disambiguation matcher or the name
parser reads as "no movement" here and can still be load-bearing — ARCHIVE_VERB_PATTERN does
exactly that. "NO MOVEMENT (scoped)" is EVIDENCE TOWARD "construct redundant", never the
verdict. Positive control: READ_SHAPE moves 2,548 / 18 outputs, so the instrument is
sensitive and a zero here is a real zero for these tiers.
